        "v": 5,
        "title": "Freebuff grace period fixed, env var removed",
        "summary": "Removed `FREEBUFF_SESSION_GRACE_MS` env var. Replaced with hardcoded `SESSION_GRACE_MS` constant in `web/src/server/free-session/config.ts`. Updated `packages/internal/src/env-schema.ts` to drop schema entry. Adjusted docs and `public-api.ts` getter to reflect fixed value.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "at": "2026-09-15T00:29:36.171Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "The waiting room for the free assistant used to let operators adjust how long it stays open after a session expires, but that knob is gone. It now stays open for a fixed 30 minutes, matching what the instructions already said. If you run the assistant and check its settings file, the old switch to change that time is no longer there. The change is live today.",
