        "model": "bai/qwen3.8-flash",
        "v": 5,
        "title": "Add DeepSeek V4 Pro provider and agent",
        "summary": "DeepSeek V4 Pro added as free model option. New `base2-free-deepseek-v4` agent uses `deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro`. Requires `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`. Reasoning tokens gated by `INCLUDE_REASONING_IN_MESSAGE_HISTORY` (default false). Covers `common/constants`, `agents/base2`, `web/llm-api`, `packages/agent-runtime`.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "at": "2026-09-15T00:29:58.557Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "A new free AI assistant named 'Buffy the DeepSeek V4 Free Orchestrator' is now available for users who can provide a DeepSeek API key. When you use this assistant, it uses the DeepSeek V4 Pro model to help you run an agent that can perform tasks on your computer, like running evals or managing software. The assistant will not save the model's private reasoning steps in the conversation history unless you turn on a special flag, and it uses an extended timeout for the longer wait times that deep-thinking models can need.",
